  "## Parameters",
  "",
  "### nextConfig?",
  "",
  "[`NextConfigLike`](../interfaces/NextConfigLike.md) = `{}`",
  "",
  "The existing Next config (default `{}`).",
  "",
  "## Examples",
  "",
  "**Wrap your next.config.mjs**",
  "",
  "```js",
